{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RC:CM - Radio Controlled: Car Maniacs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RC:CM isn\u2019t just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a childhood dream brought to life: commanding a powerful scaled vehicle via remote control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/1b1d3634eae81d200428331af549ab2f.poster.avif?t=1745763680\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/1b1d3634eae81d200428331af549ab2f.webm?t=1745763680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/1b1d3634eae81d200428331af549ab2f.mp4?t=1745763680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RC:CM immerses you in the world of the latest modern RC cars. Race with 15 different radio-controlled vehicles in dynamic weather conditions across 10 unique maps, each tailored to 5 distinct vehicle classes.[/p]<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/8e218e1509b6faefed2e77029a5e4dbf.poster.avif?t=1745763680\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/8e218e1509b6faefed2e77029a5e4dbf.webm?t=1745763680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/8e218e1509b6faefed2e77029a5e4dbf.mp4?t=1745763680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge other players in online multiplayer. RC:CM features a full day-night cycle and dynamic weather effects like rain, wind, and fog. Each track offers unique challenges and driving nuances. Compete with friends in real-time races, check out leaderboards, and fight for the best lap times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/aed7677b15b240eaf99b8cc3b77a6573.poster.avif?t=1745763680\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/aed7677b15b240eaf99b8cc3b77a6573.webm?t=1745763680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/aed7677b15b240eaf99b8cc3b77a6573.mp4?t=1745763680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Advanced physics engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Track surfaces influence grip depending on the terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Multiple engine types: Electric and Nitro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Detailed suspension simulation adapting to every surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Carefully crafted audio for each track surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Realistic environmental soundscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Original soundtrack written specifically for the game, creating a unique atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Choose and save your favorite cinematic angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Take high-quality screenshots in original resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Custom resolutions, screenshot presets, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replays</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Record and replay your sessions at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Save and share your replays with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2981 Fine-tuned replay settings for smooth and cinematic playback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We\u2019ll see you on the track!</strong></h2></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2717940?t=1745763680","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2717940?t=1745763680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745763680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745763680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RC:CM - Radio Controlled: Car Maniacs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RC:CM isn\u2019t just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a childhood dream brought to life: commanding a powerful scaled vehicle via remote control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/1b1d3634eae81d200428331af549ab2f.poster.avif?t=1745763680\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/1b1d3634eae81d200428331af549ab2f.webm?t=1745763680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717940/extras/1b1d3634eae81d200428331